  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The overall objective for the IBFAN-GIFA Straegic Plan 2003-2008 is to contribute to the creation of an environment that will enable mothers, families, caregivers, in all circumstances, to make and implement informed decisions about breastfeeding and optimal feeding practices for infants and young children. Main activities regards capacity building of IBFAN network, make strong executive board resol</narrative>
